        "## Average Delay by Hub\n",
        "\n",
        "Average delivery delay time is calculated for each operational hub using timestamp differences between dispatch and completion times.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "To identify hubs experiencing the highest operational delays."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6iJXIDRN5VBD"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "sqldf(\n",
        "\"SELECT d.hub_id,\n",
        "       AVG((julianday(d.delivery_completed_at) - julianday(d.dispatch_time)) * 1440 - (o.promised_window_hours * 60)) AS avg_delay_minutes\n",
        "FROM deliveries d\n",
        "JOIN orders o ON d.order_id = o.order_id\n",
        "GROUP BY d.hub_id\n",
        "ORDER BY avg_delay_minutes DESC\n",
        "LIMIT 5;\"\n",
        ")"
